    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Collocations, support verbs and governed cases",
     "texto": [
      "Some frequent combinations are learned as units: **podjąć decyzję** («to take a decision»), **złożyć wniosek** («to submit an application») and **zwrócić uwagę na** («to pay attention to»).",
      "The verb carries part of the meaning and determines the form of the complement. Learn the combination in a sentence and check the case after the preposition or verb."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
